  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> be the side of the triangle and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> the length <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∆</mo><mi>AHG</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∆</mo><mi>AEC</mi></math>&nbsp;are similar triangles.<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image15-79d97243-ca76-46f2-95ac-868376d0350f.jpg\" style=\"height: 142px; width: 200px;\" /><br /><br />Induced e.m.f., <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Induced current, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><br />Thus, the&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math> graph is a straight line with a negative slope and positive intercept.</p>",
